<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY SIX.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY SIX.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the sixth day</p>
<p>of the Hopman Cup mixed team tennis tournament on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>2-Switzerland beat Germany 3-0</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>Martina Hingis beat Petra Begerow 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Marc Rosset beat Bernd Karbacher 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Rosset/Hingis beat Karbacher/Begerow 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>3-South Africa beat Romania 2-1 (South African names first)</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer lost to Irina Spirlea 7-5 4-6 1-6</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira beat Adrian Voinea 7-6 (11-9) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Ferreira/Coetzer beat Voinea/Spirlea 4-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>South Africa meet United States in the final.</p>
</text>
